</div>
<p>Skirting the sound barrier here. My entry to Exquisite Corpse Contest after many rounds of wrestling with another person’s writing and wondering about our combined sanity.</p>
<p>A scip about inter-microbial warfare and the lengths the Foundation will go to contain it. At the end of the day, we’re all trying to escape containment.</p>
