<p>This is decent but I have to agree with AndrewOBT here. This isn't simply about the foundation wanting to learn more, this is them being inept morons. I've read hundreds of SCPs and they are very rarely this careless.<br />
I can get over that bit, but the &quot;containment procedures&quot; of &quot;let's have a D class press their finger on it&quot; is WAY too ridiculous. You could easily have something like a machine do it automatically or hell, go the obvious route of placing it in an airtight container&#8230;<br />
Even if for some reason you HAD to use a finger, you know that some moisture would get left on your finger and eventually there would be no drop of water left, right?</p>

